# A shared battle's link is /play/<code>. That is not a file: the player page
# is play.html, which Pages serves at /play, so every code is rewritten there
# (200, not a redirect — the address bar keeps the code for the page to read).
#
# The target is /play, not /play.html: Pages strips ".html" from paths, and a
# rule pointing at the ".html" name is treated as a loop and silently dropped.
# /api/* is served by Functions before this file is consulted.
/play/* /play 200
